WEBVTT

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:07.960
The following program
is intended for mature audiences

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.630
and contains Adult Content,
Graphic Language, Graphic Violence,

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.760
Brief Nudity and Strong Sexual Content
including rape.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.780
Edo Castle?

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.120
I see.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:50.590
Blade of the Immortal

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.010
One, two, three

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:57.300
Undead tree

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.720
What truth

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:03.390
I'll come true

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:10.570
Wow

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.450
I see that bright light

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:20.830
This is all I have

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.330
What did you say?
I know

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:29.880
Why do you say?

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:35.550
Hone the blade
Lie around

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:42.260
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:46.600
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:50.360
Survive of vision

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.650
Unfinished heaven

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:57.400
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:01.160
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:05.960
Survive of vision

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.520
Miss Tanpopo?

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:27.600
You're awake?

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:30.440
Where's Renzo?

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.900
He left a while ago saying he needed to pee.

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:35.360
Now that I think about it, it has been a while.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:44.200
Right now, we're on our way to tell Lord Habaki

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.660
that four of the Itto-ryu's leaders are missing.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:50.790
-Lord Mitake!
-It's you two. This is urgent.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:54.960
Last night, four of the Itto-ryu rampaged
through Edo Castle.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:57.760
The Itto-ryu of Mitoji are nothing but deceivers!

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:03.050
Our news of these happenings
will be anything but news!

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:08.060
To be honest, it left me exhausted,
running in circles as we were.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:11.190
So when we pulled out as were we told...

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:16.650
we passed by a horse mounted by
someone who clearly resembled Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.610
But we'd already made up our minds to turn a blind eye.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:24.990
So I guess you two have been through the wringer.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.370
You got that right!

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:30.830
So listen up, it's not like we came back
in order to save you guys.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.460
We have an understanding here?

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.210
We do, we do.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:38.170
What gall have you channeled to say that in front of me?

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:39.470
Why should I care?

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:45.140
What do I have to fear from the injured,
you horse's baggage, you!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.350
-A horse's...?
-Besides, what's it to you?

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:51.100
Rin, how are they feeling? Your legs.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.270
Better.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.150
Though I can't move them yet.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:56.900
I can feel my blood flowing through now.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:04:01.610
You were in the water the whole time,
but that may be a blessing in disguise.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:05.280
It's not as cold as ice or snow.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.290
But Mr. Manji on the other hand...

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:13.170
I'm sorry! I didn't think
two frostbitten people would warm each other.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.500
Right, that's...

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.210
Then with your permission, I'll be his blanket!

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.130
Hey!

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.100
Renzo...

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.940
Abayama...

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:42.490
Is it about time we thin them out?

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:46.620
I think so.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.910
That's dangerous. Put that thing down.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.120
I have business with that man.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:57.580
What will you do?

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:59.340
I'm taking both his arms.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.920
The right arm is what was buried.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.890
After that, I picked up the left.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:11.140
He should have lost them both already.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:13.600
So that's what I'll do.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.100
That's normal for a human.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.230
Back away from there.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:20.820
I'm not moving.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.740
I don't know anything about Mr. Manji's body,

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:28.120
but even I can tell what would happen
if he were to be cut in his state.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.620
I don't know all the circumstances,

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:36.170
but you won't get far with arms as thin as yours.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.460
A freshly sharpened sword would be one thing,

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:41.050
but one that's been soaked in blood...

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:44.300
-You won't get far.
-I don't get it.

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:47.510
Why does everyone protect him?

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:50.430
He's killed so many!

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:53.600
Why are you all so concerned about his wellbeing?

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:57.190
Isn't he the same scum, the same demon as Shira?

00:05:58.350 --> 00:05:59.560
I...

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:02.480
I never cared for that man at all.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.070
He put me through horrors.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.740
Countless times I thought,
"He should die. I'm going to kill him."

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.030
And yet...

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:16.040
just like this man, he fought until there
was nothing left.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:21.500
For this man to be surrounded by people,

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:24.800
while he was alone...

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.760
So shouldn't he at least lose his arms?

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.180
-He's a killer--
-Okay.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.060
In that case...

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.110
What are you doing?

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.360
Out of my way.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.240
Hear me, Renzo.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:53.620
I killed him.

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.120
Your father, I mean.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:01.380
To be specific, I always resented Araya Kawakami.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:05.670
So I hired Mr. Manji as a bodyguard to kill him.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:09.680
So the one you should point your sword at is me.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.850
But there's something I must see, so I cannot die.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:15.890
Though I can do it well enough without arms.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:19.810
So I'll give them to you, both of them.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:23.520
This person
is someone who will take me there,

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:26.280
no matter what condition my body is in.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:34.200
I had a feeling there was something
suspicious about Sister and Father.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.950
But what could I do?

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:39.250
I don't know anything about my father!

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:41.290
Tell me!

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.580
What did Father do to you?

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.130
No one will tell me!

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:48.590
How should I know what to do
and to whom it should be done?

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:56.180
Why won't you say? Screw this!

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.900
Whoa, that was close.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:09.940
You almost spilled the hotpot.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:20.790
I hope you don't think your silence
passes as compassion.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:31.800
Kid, do you know the Itto-ryu?

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:34.050
I don't, but...

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.720
That so?

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:39.060
Then remember this.

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:42.600
It's the school of swordsmanship your father studied.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:46.270
Kid, knowing comes first.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:49.650
Engrave the name "Itto-ryu" in your heart
and return to Edo.

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:53.950
Then once you've learned all about your father,
make the final decision.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.700
Whether you'll hate or forgive.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.540
You may well grow up in your wandering.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:07.500
No matter the years that pass,
this man will appear before you again, unchanged.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:13.170
Mr. Abayama, where did Koji go off to alone?

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.390
There's a village at the southern foot of Mount Tsukuba.

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:19.890
It's Koji's birthplace.

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:25.770
That old man went to do some hunting
only fit for those raised in the mountains.

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:30.360
All who enter his hunting ground will become prey.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:32.990
That would include us.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:42.790
Mosuke, is your father still kicking?

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:45.750
Yes, by the grace of god.

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:51.250
I will open the vases. Make ready at once.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:58.430
We only took one of the Itto-ryu.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:00.970
If they're acting with foreknowledge of us...

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.890
I believe it to be a trap.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:06.520
Yet, if that is all the Itto-ryu have to offer,

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.600
we will catch them and kill them in the same fashion.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.360
I shall go.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:15.860
Be it some trap or what have you,
it won't stop them being killed from afar.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:21.200
-At the very least, one more should accompany--
-I will go.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:31.710
You're Mr. Habaki's biological daughter, no?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.210
What of it?

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:36.970
You normally don't send your daughter into a trap.

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:40.890
Lord Habaki has chosen to fulfill my request.

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:47.930
I am filled with delight now,
that I might receive a token of his trust.

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:53.400
I'm shocked his parental instincts haven't taken hold
now that we've laid eyes upon Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:54.520
Mr. Ban.

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.860
Do you mean to insult Lord Habaki?

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.910
Why must it come to that?

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.740
I merely spoke of obvious parent-child bonds.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.740
I see.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.660
You're right.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.080
I don't like the eyes she gave me.

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:13.040
-If he's really her father...
 -Mr. Ban, look.

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:17.380
There's no doubt.

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:22.180
So that's him? Hey!

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:28.180
What's this all about?

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:37.730
They went out of their way to be killed.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:42.910
You go on ahead.

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.240
But...

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.450
Get a move on.

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:48.500
-Sir.
-Stop pushing.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.210
You go in next.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:54.130
No, the rear guard and vanguard face equal peril.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:56.590
I will stand guard, so please--

00:11:57.960 --> 00:11:59.550
I said go on ahead.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:05.510
Do you intend to flee?

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:09.640
So it's just as Lord Habaki said.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.350
What?

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.690
When Lord Habaki mobilized the separate unit,

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:19.530
he assigned me, Mr. Arashino
and Mr. Mitake to watch over it,

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:22.360
to oust defectors such as yourself.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:24.780
I see, then...

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:26.870
I'm aware.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:29.660
Lord Habaki believed in me.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.660
He believed that I'd be able to stop you.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.460
I'm petrified.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.810
Why?

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:58.360
If you die, I'll become their focus.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:00.150
Mr. Ban...

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.610
Fool!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.320
Amazing.

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:14.330
How in the world?

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:30.470
You must be kidding!

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:40.440
At least give me a chance to reload.

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:45.900
-Next is--
 -Worry not.

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:49.410
We are now matched in number.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:53.870
There are none left but me.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.500
What's the plan now?

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:03.550
I'm worried about the Hebi Squad.

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:05.590
Let's split up and search for them.

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:09.840
There are likely more traps,
so take plenty of care where you step.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:12.180
Am I the one who needs reminding?

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.640
Right...

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:32.160
I found them.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.670
What's this?

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:55.600
Thank you for taking the time to breath it in.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:59.690
Old man, what have you--?

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.650
It's carbonic acid.

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:07.110
Breath it in at a high concentration for long
and you'll end up like them.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.360
Headache and nausea,

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:13.580
followed eventually by respiratory failure and death.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:19.500
With 40 of those vases,
the mountain is brimming with the gas.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.540
But you're all...

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:26.000
We are accustomed to it.

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:30.340
We are a mountain people
who spend two thirds of the year on mountains

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.550
of higher elevation than here.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:36.100
Do you understand what that means?

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:39.850
Our bodies are very much used to thin air.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:46.150
Since entering this forest, I have been breathing
only a third of the oxygen a normal person would need.

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:49.150
That's why the bows...?

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.450
Indeed.

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:54.240
We needed you to move about.

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:57.700
You were very troublesome.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:01.290
You move even less than we do.

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:04.920
But your endgame was lacking.

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.250
You, Rokki...

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:13.550
I personally do not possess the strength
of the other Itto-ryu members.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:17.010
But let me choose the time and place...

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:24.690
and I have confidence I can take on
every last one of you on my own.

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:30.490
These are acupuncture needles.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:34.200
Allow me to show you a puncture point
that grants a painless death.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:38.370
Give up. Your aim too will suffer--

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:45.670
-Dang it!
-My, my, the tenacity of this one.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.290
Die!

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:04.600
Goodness.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.560
How brash of him.

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:16.070
He's dead? Mr. Ban? We've been wiped out?

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.950
By that elderly man?

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:21.750
I must report to Lord Habaki.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:23.710
No. We must be victorious.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:27.750
I can't afford to let such a dangerous opponent live.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.550
But how?

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:34.550
Right, I'll resuscitate Mr. Ban.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:37.760
My arms and legs are no good.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.850
Somewhere movement isn't hindered.

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:43.220
Ears? No, I'll be found out right away.

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:46.940
Think! How can he be killed?

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:49.940
Resuscitate, get caught.

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:52.690
Wait, don't lose consciousness yet.

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:55.150
I have to be useful to Lord Habaki!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:58.200
Together until the end...

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:03.040
I will be at Lord Habaki's side.

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:16.010
They sent one so young.

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:20.430
Hands used only for hard labor.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:25.230
If lumber falls in a clash of warriors,

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:28.770
then what we've killed are trees.

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:31.400
My apologies, young lady.

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:45.870
Please don't worry about me.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:48.040
What--?

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:16.150
It was a samurai that showed up about an hour ago.

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:19.900
The authorities said they'd compensate us afterwards.

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:23.620
Don't you perish just yet, Mr. Abayama.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:31.670
Why do I remember this road?

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:37.260
Lord Mitake! Why do we travel away from Lord Habaki?

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:42.340
No. Where are you taking me? Lord Mitake!

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:48.350
Lord Habaki's orders. I am to take you to Edo
and confine you until this is over.

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:50.440
This can't be...

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:54.860
A warrior and someone as strict as Lord Habaki
would never fret over a child.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.030
Cease this childish rant!

00:19:57.110 --> 00:20:01.110
It's because of your desire to surpass
the father-daughter relationship with Lord Habaki

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.360
that you cannot grasp his feelings in this.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:06.950
Lord Habaki has nothing else left.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.370
Not his house, his resources, or his wife and child!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:16.840
You must understand the pertinence of the survival
of the one girl who yet carries Lord Habaki's blood.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.590
"Blood"?

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:22.260
"Girl"?

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:28.560
What meaning is there in a house with no father?

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:31.230
Don't leave me. I...

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:34.690
Miss Ryo!

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:40.820
You two! Do not lay a hand on her!

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.400
Mitake?

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:46.120
-One.
-One.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:48.620
-Two.
-Two.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.200
-One.
-Excuse me, Miss Tanpopo, Miss Meguro!

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:55.040
-Two. One--
-I'll leave Renzo to you from here.

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:56.750
Yeah, got it.

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:59.460
-Leaving already?
-Yeah.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:02.590
But Rin hasn't fully recovered yet.

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:05.300
Shouldn't you watch over her a while longer?

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:10.100
She would hate
that kind of attention more than anything.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:16.560
So this is Habaki's daughter?

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:19.190
An illegitimate child though?

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:22.070
So that thing is a father too, huh?

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.070
I've requested that you be looked after,

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:30.370
and if I haven't returned in three days, to be released.

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:32.370
Can this be settled in three days?

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:35.670
Were you with us, it would take two.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:40.210
We should be able to handle the ragtag remains
of the Itto-ryu on the highway.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:43.420
But if the four who launched
a night assault on Edo Castle,

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:47.430
especially Kagehisa Anotsu, return unscathed,

00:21:47.510 --> 00:21:52.970
the only ones who can face them head on
are Lord Habaki and yourself.

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:55.270
I understand.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:00.770
I shall be a shield.

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:09.320
Four of them, you say? What about that?

00:22:09.410 --> 00:22:12.910
Sir, Mr. Mitake has handled it, as per your orders.

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:20.290
Ten are left.

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:23.880
We must strike before they converge.

00:23:50.630 --> 00:23:54.890
Act Twenty One - Trap
